# Vexana, Shimmer of Hope

> Vexana is not a blind-pick mid. She is a punish mage that turns crowded fights and obvious movement into free damage. If your draft can start first or the map forces the enemy through narrow entrances, she feels oppressive; if you need her to create space alone, she looks slow and fake.

